DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41795::$$$message_0223_0000_0000$$$::"Thou hast finally arrived.[lr]::
41796::$$$message_0223_0000_0001$$$::Bearer of the Holy Grail, wretched yet beautiful, devoted to thy wish...[playstop time=400 nowait=1]"[nolr]::
41797::$$$message_0223_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
41798::$$$message_0223_0000_0003$$$::"..."::
41799::$$$message_0223_0000_0004$$$::"..."::
41800::$$$message_0223_0000_0005$$$::"..."[lr]::
41801::$$$message_0223_0000_0006$$$::"...This is taking a while. [wait canskip=0 time=300]I guess it's what they say about people who are too alike to get along. It was never going to be that easy... Wait, [wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=ランサー face=怒 layer=0 time=200][hfstamp layer=0][se volume=80 storage=se564.wav]whoa!"::
41802::$$$message_0223_0000_0007$$$::"There's a fine man here who's the spitting image, no, a little less good-looking than me but who clearly knows my pain!"::
41803::$$$message_0223_0000_0008$$$::"Would ya look at that. Wow, when did this turn into a heavenly otome game!?"::
41804::$$$message_0223_0000_0009$$$::"...[lr]::
41805::$$$message_0223_0000_0010$$$::No, you're just a moron."::
41806::$$$message_0223_0000_0011$$$::"No, I'm not!"::
41807::$$$message_0223_0000_0012$$$::"I'm kidding.[lr]::
41808::$$$message_0223_0000_0013$$$::We're not monkeys staring into a mirror. We both know what's up."::
41809::$$$message_0223_0000_0014$$$::"Wow, how unusual for two of the same Heroic Spirit to be summoned into the same era."::
41810::$$$message_0223_0000_0015$$$::"It's certainly possible with the Servant system. So are we looking at a good Cú Chulainn and an evil one?"::
41811::$$$message_0223_0000_0016$$$::"Pretty much. Though I'm neutral, so it's not like I'd split into good and evil halves."::
41812::$$$message_0223_0000_0017$$$::"If there's subtle differences in how I manifest, it would come down to the difference between Masters."::
41813::$$$message_0223_0000_0018$$$::"Oh, piss off. Don't lump us together when you're obviously meant purely for comic relief."::
41814::$$$message_0223_0000_0019$$$::"You wot, mate!?[lr]::
41815::$$$message_0223_0000_0020$$$::What's so funny about me!?"::
41816::$$$message_0223_0000_0021$$$::"Wha?"::
41817::$$$message_0223_0000_0022$$$::"Uh, let's chalk it up to a question of nurture over nature.[lr]::
41818::$$$message_0223_0000_0023$$$::...You do have my sympathies."::
41819::$$$message_0223_0000_0024$$$::"Lancer, I never thought that you could be such a straight man. He must be blessed with a particularly rare colleague and boss[line len=2]"::
41820::$$$message_0223_0000_0025$$$::"What are you doing? Wrap this up so we can take a[line len=2][wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=ポカーン layer=0 time=100]Wh-[wait canskip=0 time=600][hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=喜 layer=0 time=100][play storage=bgm143.ogg][hfquake time=1000 vmax=8 hmax=8 layer=0 wait=0][hfquake layer=message0 time=1000 wait=0 vmax=8 hmax=8]WHOA!"::
41821::$$$message_0223_0000_0026$$$::"This mixer is so absolutely destined it's blinding me![lr]::
41822::$$$message_0223_0000_0027$$$::Who is that stunningly lovely child, Lancer!?[lr]::
41823::$$$message_0223_0000_0028$$$::A god!?"::
41824::$$$message_0223_0000_0029$$$::"..."::
41825::$$$message_0223_0000_0030$$$::"I should have expected that you'd go for anyone as long as they were childish and blond.[lr]::
41826::$$$message_0223_0000_0031$$$::But he's a boy, you know."::
41827::$$$message_0223_0000_0032$$$::"Nrgh. Don't mock me, fool![lr]::
41828::$$$message_0223_0000_0033$$$::Anything cute is A-okay in my royal register. Know that [font italic=true]true[font italic=false] heroes don't discriminate based on gender!"::
41829::$$$message_0223_0000_0034$$$::"Oh, my. To think that you were a narcissist on top of being self-righteous, elitist, self-centered, and an incorrigible monarchist...[wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=カレン face=喜2 layer=1 time=200] (spellbound)"::
41830::$$$message_0223_0000_0035$$$::"Ahahahaha.[lr]::
41831::$$$message_0223_0000_0036$$$::Hey everyone, let's kill him first."::
41832::$$$message_0223_0000_0037$$$::"Hm, another check failed.[lr]::
41833::$$$message_0223_0000_0038$$$::Where did I go wrong, Lancer? I didn't even get a dialogue choice."::
41834::$$$message_0223_0000_0039$$$::"Probably from the moment you sprang into existence... Hey, Kotomine. Say something."::
41835::$$$message_0223_0000_0040$$$::"...Yes, well...[lr]::
41836::$$$message_0223_0000_0041$$$::This is an unexpected gathering, but the fact remains that only the victor may proceed."::
41837::$$$message_0223_0000_0042$$$::"However...girl.[lr]::
41838::$$$message_0223_0000_0043$$$::You don't seem to have a wish of your own. Why are you here?"::
41839::$$$message_0223_0000_0044$$$::"...I suppose you could say there is something I want, even if I don't have a wish."::
41840::$$$message_0223_0000_0045$$$::"Although, I suppose I could obtain it without the power of the onsen."::
41841::$$$message_0223_0000_0046$$$::"Oh? Would you mind sharing what that is?[lr]::
41842::$$$message_0223_0000_0047$$$::What could an inhuman being like yourself desire?"::
41843::$$$message_0223_0000_0048$$$::"For the time being, I'd like to solidify my position."::
41844::$$$message_0223_0000_0049$$$::"Even now, you can see how our personalities, clothes, and even Servants overlap. It's quite a nuisance, don't you think?"::
41845::$$$message_0223_0000_0050$$$::"So you use conflict to eliminate threats, rather than build your own foundation.[lr]::
41846::$$$message_0223_0000_0051$$$::And you consider your predecessor a nuisance?"::
41847::$$$message_0223_0000_0052$$$::"Yes, and I have a long list of grievances, to boot.[lr]::
41848::$$$message_0223_0000_0053$$$::I do want it so very badly...[se storage=se452.wav]your life."::
41849::$$$message_0223_0000_0054$$$::"Such a twisted child you are.[lr]::
41850::$$$message_0223_0000_0055$$$::It saddens me to see, as a married man. I wish I could see your father react to this."::
41851::$$$message_0223_0000_0056$$$::"On that, we agree. I'd love to know what the absentee father who 'raised' me this way thinks."::
41852::$$$message_0223_0000_0057$$$::"...Though I'm sure I'd feel an overwhelming urge to vomit upon seeing his face."::
41853::$$$message_0223_0000_0058$$$::"Heh."::
41854::$$$message_0223_0000_0059$$$::"Hehe."[lr]::
41855::$$$message_0223_0000_0060$$$::[hfu][cm]"[hfl]"He[hfu]He[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]![hfl]![hfu]"[hfl]"[nolr]::
41856::$$$message_0223_0001_0000$$$::"Hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!"[nolr]::
41857::$$$message_0223_0002_0000$$$::"Good![lr]::
41858::$$$message_0223_0002_0001$$$::This looks fun! Count me in!"::
41859::$$$message_0223_0002_0002$$$::"People who can't read the room are so...headstrong."::
41860::$$$message_0223_0002_0003$$$::"Ahahahahaha.[lr]::
41861::$$$message_0223_0002_0004$$$::I genuinely want him dead."::
41862::$$$message_0223_0002_0005$$$::"Oh, but there's no point in killing him here... The future is so cruel... I don't want to grow up..."::

